function categoryIcon(id){const paths={bedding:'M3 19V9m18 10V9M3 15h18M5 15V7h14v8M7 11h4m2 0h4',towels:'M6 4h12v16H6zM6 15h12M9 17h6',protectors:'M4 7l8-3 8 3v10l-8 3-8-3zM4 11l8 3 8-3M12 14v6',duvets:'M5 4h14v16H5zM5 9h14M10 9v11M15 9v11',covers:'M4 5h16v14H4zM4 14h16M7 19v2m5-2v2m5-2v2',pillows:'M4 5q8 2 16 0-2 7 0 14-8-2-16 0 2-7 0-14Z',new:'M12 3l2.5 6.5L21 12l-6.5 2.5L12 21l-2.5-6.5L3 12l6.5-2.5Z'};return `<svg class="category-icon" aria-hidden="true" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.35" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="${paths[id]||paths.bedding}"/></svg>`}
